      {
        "id": 6455,
        "title": "Classi degli oggetti",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Thousands of objects",
            "id": 56055,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando scriviamo programmi complessi, dovremo creare molti oggetti simili ma distinti. Per esempio, tutti i libri della biblioteca.</p><p>Ma creare un nuovo oggetto per migliaia di libri richiederebbe molto tempo e potrebbe causare errori.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" book100 = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"author\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;William Shakespeare&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;The Da Vinci Code&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(book100);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{ author: 'William Shakespeare', title: 'The Da Vinci Code' }\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Classes",
            "id": 56065,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [
              {
                "id": "8768bcaf-e921-421f-a4af-297383e73de6"
              }
            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><img src=\"8768bcaf-e921-421f-a4af-297383e73de6\" visible-if=\"always\" /><p>Per rendere questo processo meno soggetto a errori e più efficiente, possiamo usare strutture dati chiamate <strong>classi</strong> come modelli.<br /></p><p>Una volta creato un modello con le proprietà che vorremo per tutti gli oggetti simili, possiamo usarlo per creare più rapidamente nuovi oggetti.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Class",
            "id": 56066,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per creare una nuova classe, iniziamo con la parola chiave <code>class</code>, un nome e le parentesi graffe.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /></interactions></code><p /><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>class</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Class",
            "id": 56114,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ogni volta che creiamo una nuova classe, dobbiamo assicurarci che il nome inizi con una <strong>lettera maiuscola</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"book\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Book</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Constructor",
            "id": 56067,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per creare nuovi oggetti, le classi hanno bisogno di un metodo speciale chiamato <code>constructor()</code>. Questo metodo imposta i valori delle proprietà per un nuovo oggetto.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"constructor\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p /><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>constructor()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per creare nuovi oggetti, le classi hanno bisogno di un metodo speciale chiamato <code>constructor()</code>. Questo metodo imposta i valori delle proprietà di un nuovo oggetto. Aggiungilo alla classe.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"constructor\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"new Book()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>constructor()</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameters",
            "id": 56068,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ci serve un modo per specificare i valori univoci che avrà un nuovo oggetto. Lo facciamo inviando dei <strong>parametri</strong> al metodo costruttore.</p><p>Qui passeremo <code>author</code> e poi <code>title</code> come parametri al metodo costruttore.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"author; title\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p /><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>author, title</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ci serve un modo per specificare i valori univoci che avrà un nuovo oggetto. Lo facciamo inviando dei <strong>parametri</strong> al metodo costruttore.</p><p>Qui passeremo <code>author</code> e poi <code>title</code> come parametri al metodo costruttore. Completa l'elenco dei parametri in quest'ordine.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"author; title\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Book\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>author</code>, seguito da <code>title</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Classes",
            "id": 56058,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa sono le <strong>classi</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Modelli per gli oggetti</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Oggetti ben definiti</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Modelli per gli oggetti.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un programma usa un'unica classe <code>Book</code> per creare molti oggetti libro. Qual è il ruolo della classe?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un modello per gli oggetti</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un oggetto ben definito</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un valore memorizzato all'interno di ogni oggetto</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un modello per gli oggetti.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Classes 2",
            "id": 56057,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché usiamo le classi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ci permettono di creare oggetti più velocemente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sono più brevi da scrivere rispetto agli oggetti</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ci permettono di creare oggetti più velocemente.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché una classe <code>Book</code> è utile quando un programma necessita di molti oggetti libro?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ci permette di creare oggetti più velocemente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">È sempre più breve da scrivere rispetto agli oggetti</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Impedisce agli oggetti di avere valori di proprietà diversi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ci permette di creare oggetti più velocemente.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Class Keyword",
            "id": 56059,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando crei una classe, quale convenzione di denominazione è importante?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I nomi delle classi iniziano con una lettera maiuscola</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è bisogno di un nome di classe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I nomi delle classi iniziano con una lettera maiuscola.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi <code>class book {}</code>. Quale modifica segue la convenzione per i nomi delle classi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Cambia book in Book.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Cambia class in Class.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Rimuovi il nome book.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Cambia book in Book.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Constructor",
            "id": 56060,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale di questi è il metodo che usiamo all'interno di una classe per creare nuovi oggetti?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>constructor()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>new Object()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>constructor</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>constructor()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno di una classe, quale metodo inizializza ogni oggetto appena creato?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>constructor()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>new Object()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La proprietà <code>constructor</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>create()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>constructor()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Parameters",
            "id": 108183,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"author\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I parametri devono trovarsi nel costruttore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una classe può avere un solo parametro</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I parametri devono trovarsi nel costruttore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La classe necessita di un <code>author</code> e un <code>title</code> per ogni nuovo libro. Dove vanno inseriti questi parametri?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"author\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nel costruttore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una classe può avere un solo parametro</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Dopo il nome della classe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Nel costruttore.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Classes",
            "id": 108184,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una classe per <code>Animal</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Animal\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Class\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>class</code>, seguito da <code>Animal</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una classe vuota chiamata <code>Animal</code>, seguendo la convenzione del nome della classe con l'iniziale maiuscola.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Animal\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Class\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"animal\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>class</code>, seguito da <code>Animal</code>, <code>{</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Constructor",
            "id": 108185,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi un <code>constructor</code> alla classe <code>Animal</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Animal\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>constructor</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un <code>constructor</code> è un metodo speciale della classe che imposta i valori delle proprietà quando viene creato un nuovo oggetto.</p><p>Aggiungi alla classe <code>Animal</code> un metodo <code>constructor</code> vuoto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Animal\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"constructor()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>constructor</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>{</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Parameters",
            "id": 108186,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi alcuni parametri alla classe <code>Animal</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Animal\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name, species) {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"41\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>name,</code>, seguito da <code>species</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 11831,
        "title": "Questo",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "This",
            "id": 108171,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prima di creare una nuova proprietà dell'oggetto, ci serve una parola chiave speciale: <code>this</code>. Aggiungiamo la parola chiave <code>this</code> per fare riferimento all'oggetto in fase di creazione.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"49\" /></interactions></code><p /><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>this</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Assigning a value",
            "id": 108176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per creare una nuova proprietà di un oggetto, dobbiamo usare la parola chiave <code>this</code> seguita da un punto e dal nome della proprietà.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p /><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>this</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>author</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per creare una nuova proprietà dell'oggetto, dobbiamo usare la parola chiave <code>this</code> seguita da un punto e dal nome della proprietà. Completa il riferimento alla proprietà <code>author</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"title\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"this()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>this</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>author</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Assigning a value",
            "id": 108172,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per completare la creazione della nuova proprietà dell'oggetto, assegneremo il parametro <code>author</code> come valore di <code>this.author</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author = author;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".title = title;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p /><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>author</code> e infine <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La parola chiave <code>this</code> indica l'oggetto creato. Aggiungi un punto e il nome di una proprietà per accedervi.</p><p>Per completare la nuova proprietà, assegna il parametro <code>author</code> come valore di <code>this.author</code>. Completa l’assegnazione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author = author;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".title = title;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"title\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>author</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>, <code>author</code>, <code>;</code> e infine <code>this</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Creating a class",
            "id": 108173,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>È il momento di usare la nostra classe. Iniziamo nello stesso modo in cui creeremmo una costante, ma poi aggiungiamo la parola chiave <code>new</code> seguita da <code>Book()</code>.</p><p>Qui assegneremo <code>new Book()</code> alla costante <code>book1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author = author;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".title = title;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" book1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Book();  \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"118\" /><option startIndex=\"119\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"125\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p /><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>new</code>, seguito da <code>Book</code> e infine <code>()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Creating a class",
            "id": 108177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo quindi aggiungere tra parentesi i valori che vogliamo impostare per il nuovo oggetto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author = author;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".title = title;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" book1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Book(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Leo Tolstoy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;War and Peace&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(book1);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Book { author: 'Leo Tolstoy', title: 'War and Peace' }\" /></content></output></code><p /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Creating a class",
            "id": 108174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ecco fatto! Ora possiamo usare le classi per creare facilmente tutti i libri che vogliamo, con molto meno codice.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author = author;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".title = title;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" book1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Book(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Leo Tolstoy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;War and Peace&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" book2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Book(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dr. Seuss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Oh, the Places You'll Go!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(book1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(book2);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Book { author: 'Leo Tolstoy', title: 'War and Peace' }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Book { author: 'Dr. Seuss', title: &quot;Oh, the Places You'll Go!&quot; }\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
