          {
            "title": "Question: this dot",
            "id": 56131,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una classe ha una proprietà <code>color</code>. Come vi accediamo dall'interno della classe?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Con <code>this.color</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Con <code>this(color)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Con <code>this.color</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo <code>this.color = color</code>, modifichi il parametro <code>color</code>. Quale espressione legge il valore salvato nell’oggetto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Con <code>this.color</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Con <code>this(color)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Con <code>color</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Con <code>this.color</code>.</p></body></html>",
