          {
            "title": "Question: new",
            "id": 56132,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale frammento di codice è il modo corretto per creare un nuovo oggetto <code>Car</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Car\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(brand, model) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".brand = brand;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".model = model;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>new Car(\"Tesla\", \"Model S\");</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Car(\"Tesla\", \"Model S\");</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>new Car(\"Tesla\", \"Model S\");</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un’auto con <code>brand</code> <code>\"Tesla\"</code> e <code>model</code> <code>\"Model S\"</code>. Quale espressione funziona?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Car\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(brand, model) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".brand = brand;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".model = model;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>new Car(\"Tesla\", \"Model S\");</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Car(\"Tesla\", \"Model S\");</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">new Car(\"Model S\", \"Tesla\");</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>new Car(\"Tesla\", \"Model S\");</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
